FPC-SAFESEH 1
# Reviewed input identities for the supplied FPC 3.2.4-rc2+1 Win32 units.
# Hashes cover whole objects, including registrations through pointer stores.
# Only linked objects are required and hashed. A new unit must be audited.
# handler = OS SEH entry; nonseh = reviewed ordinary function/callback.
# A handler may be absent only with an explicit Removing object(section) map record.
version 3.2.4-rc2+1
target i386-win32

